## Pipeline

This repository owns no pipeline logic. `.github/workflows/ci.yml` calls the
organisation platform, which reads `.platform.yml` and runs:

`security gate → test → build · scan · sign → deploy`

| branch | what happens |
|---|---|
| any branch / pull request | security gate + tests only |
| `deploy/staging` | full pipeline, deploys to staging |
| `deploy/prod` | full pipeline, deploys to production after approval |

## Local development

```bash
cp .env.example .env      # then fill in real values — .env is never committed
pre-commit install        # refuses commits containing secrets
docker compose up
```
